      "self": "https://fedora-repository.atlassian.net/rest/api/3/user?accountId=557058%3Ae25d94d0-bd50-4c2c-906c-14cdf85801fb",
      "timeZone": "America/Halifax"
     },
     "body": "<p>This has been addressed in trunk and maintenance-3.3.  This is now equivalent to the AuthN challenge control offered by Fedora 3.2, which, as noted, is still not ideal.  See followup issue, \n    <span class=\"jira-issue-macro resolved\" data-jira-key=\"FCREPO-668\" >\n                <a href=\"https://fedora-repository.atlassian.net/browse/FCREPO-668\" class=\"jira-issue-macro-key issue-link\"  title=\"Improved Authentication Challenge Control\" >\n            <img class=\"icon\" src=\"https://fedora-repository.atlassian.net/rest/api/2/universal_avatar/view/type/issuetype/avatar/10315?size=medium\" />\n            FCREPO-668\n        </a>\n                                                    <span class=\"aui-lozenge aui-lozenge-subtle aui-lozenge-success jira-macro-single-issue-export-pdf\">Closed</span>\n            </span>\n (Improved AuthN challenge control).</p>",
     "created": "18/Mar/10 11:33 AM",
     "id": "11262",
     "jsdPublic": true,
     "self": "https://fedora-repository.atlassian.net/rest/api/3/issue/10567/comment/11262",
     "updateAuthor": {
      "accountId": "557058:e25d94d0-bd50-4c2c-906c-14cdf85801fb",
      "accountType": "atlassian",
      "active": true,
      "avatarUrls": {
